  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: bf4f262a1aa38324dbaa9c5bb2e08f90, type: 3}
  m_Name: Aksacal
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Aksacal
  name: Aksakal
  IdleReplices:
  - There are moments when no shoulder is there to lean on... and even standing upright
    feels like a lie.
  - When I observe human deeds, I sometimes think... perhaps every misfortune is
    deserved.
  - Wisdom is not comfort, child. It is simply clearer pain.
  - I have spent my life asking questions. Few of them ever answered me back.
  - The older you get, the less you expect from people. That is not wisdom. That
    is exhaustion.
  HoverReplices:
  - Why does one need a heart if it grows silent?
  - Why strength, if you are destined to retreat?
  - Why power, if you do not understand what you are doing with it?
  DragReplices:
  - You are certain of this path? Then walk it. I will not stop you... nor will I
    save you.
  - Every decision leaves a mark. Some are just easier to ignore than others.
  PutInReplices:
  - So it ends like this... Not judgment. Just continuation of the same cruel logic.
  InBoilReplices:
  - AAAAAH!!!
  - 'IT BURNS... SO CLEARLY... SO UNDENIABLY!!! '
  - "SO THIS IS WHAT ALL MY \u201CWISDOM\u201D LEADS TO?!"
  - THERE IS NO TRUTH HERE, ONLY PAIN!!!
  - I SPENT MY LIFE UNDERSTANDING PEOPLE... AND STILL COULD NOT UNDERSTAND THIS!!!
  - IF THIS IS JUSTICE... THEN I HAVE NEVER UNDERSTOOD JUSTICE AT ALL!!!
  bonusDescription: 
  SoulTalking: 0
  wallSizeBonus: 1.2
